			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210340101,
					"content": "Hmph, looks like it should be here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340102,
						210340103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340102,
					"content": "Lan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210340104,
					"content": "Traveler. I didn't expect to see you here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340105,
					"content": "Do you remember the sword hilt you found last time? Well, it turns out that it was indeed part of the Unseen Razor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340106,
					"content": "The funny thing is, the only reason I could recognize it is because I secretly etched a marking onto it as a child...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340107,
					"content": "I remember I told my brother that if he ever decided to wield another sword, he had to give the Unseen Razor to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340108,
					"content": "Heh. I suppose neither one of us could have foreseen how things turned out... I can't believe this is how I ended up finding the Unseen Razor. Looks like the sword... really did get shattered.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340109,
					"content": "Alright. I suppose I'll cut to the chase now that you're here, Traveler. I'm going to need your help again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340110,
					"content": "Two gatherings of monsters should be loitering somewhere ahead. They seem to have amassed a sizable inventory of damaged weapons to hoard within their camps, though I'm uncertain as to why.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340111,
					"content": "The Adventurers' Guild is worried that these monsters will wreak havoc on the surroundings and originally wanted to draft a commission to resolve this. However, after I reviewed the details, I thought that perhaps... I could find some pieces of the Unseen Razor here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340112,
					"content": "Traveler, let's each clear out a camp.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340113,
					"content": "The camp to the left is being held by a group of hilichurls. Alone, each of them should present no danger to you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340114,
					"content": "But their numbers are substantial. Should you face them directly and all at once, it might require some effort to prevail, even for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340115,
					"content": "On the right is a Stonehide Lawachurl. As for how dangerous facing one is... I don't think I really need to elaborate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340116,
					"content": "Since I'm the one who asked for your aid, I'll let you select which camp to clear.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lan"
				},
				{
					"id": 210340103,
					"content": "What are you doing here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210340104
					]
				}
			]
		},
